---
// Merging two channels in select: why closed channels spin 100% CPU vs nil-ing closed channels to disable select branches.
const W = 900;
const H = 310;
---
<figure class="gcnil">
  <div class="gcnil-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Showdown between leaving a closed channel inside a select loop causing an infinite 100% CPU busy loop receiving zero values versus setting ch = nil on close so select disables that branch cleanly.">
      {/* Left: Closed channel spins */}
      <rect x="14" y="16" width="426" height="276" rx="10" class="gcnil-card is-red" />
      <text x="30" y="44" class="gcnil-h-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Closed channel left in select → 100% CPU spin</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Để nguyên channel đã đóng trong select → lặp vô tận</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="64" width="394" height="86" rx="6" class="gcnil-box" />
      <text x="44" y="88" class="gcnil-b">select {'{'}</text>
      <text x="44" y="108" class="gcnil-code-red">case v := &lt;-ch1: // closed → fires every tick!</text>
      <text x="44" y="128" class="gcnil-m">case v := &lt;-ch2: // starved or randomly picked</text>
      <text x="44" y="143" class="gcnil-b">{'}'}</text>

      <rect x="30" y="166" width="394" height="106" rx="6" class="gcnil-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="190" class="gcnil-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Why the loop never sleeps:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tại sao vòng lặp đốt sạch 100% CPU:</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="212" class="gcnil-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Reading from a closed channel NEVER blocks</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Đọc từ channel đã đóng KHÔNG BAO GIỜ block</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="232" class="gcnil-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Returns (zeroValue, ok=false) immediately</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Trả ngay (giá trị 0, ok=false) ở mọi lượt lặp</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="252" class="gcnil-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Select picks randomly when multiple cases ready</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Select chọn ngẫu nhiên khi nhiều nhánh sẵn sàng</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right: nil channel trick */}
      <rect x="460" y="16" width="426" height="276" rx="10" class="gcnil-card is-ok" />
      <text x="476" y="44" class="gcnil-h-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Set ch1 = nil when closed → branch disabled</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Gán ch1 = nil khi đóng → tắt gọn nhánh đó</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="476" y="64" width="394" height="86" rx="6" class="gcnil-box" />
      <text x="490" y="88" class="gcnil-b">case v, open := &lt;-ch1:</text>
      <text x="490" y="108" class="gcnil-code-ok">  if !open {'{'} ch1 = nil {'}'} // nil disables this branch</text>
      <text x="490" y="128" class="gcnil-m">case v, open := &lt;-ch2:</text>
      <text x="490" y="143" class="gcnil-m">  if !open {'{'} ch2 = nil {'}'}</text>

      <rect x="476" y="166" width="394" height="106" rx="6" class="gcnil-box is-ok" />
      <text x="490" y="190" class="gcnil-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>How nil channels simplify orchestration:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tác dụng của nil channel trong điều phối:</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="212" class="gcnil-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Send/receive on a nil channel blocks forever</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Gửi/nhận trên nil channel block vĩnh viễn</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="232" class="gcnil-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• select ignores nil cases and listens only to ch2</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• select tự bỏ qua nhánh nil, chỉ lắng nghe ch2</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="252" class="gcnil-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Loop exits cleanly when ch1 == nil &amp;&amp; ch2 == nil</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Thoát gọn khi cả ch1 và ch2 cùng bằng nil</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A closed channel returns immediately forever; a nil channel blocks forever. Assigning ch = nil inside a select loop is the idiomatic way to disable a finished stream without spinning CPU.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Channel đã đóng trả về ngay lập tức không ngừng; còn nil channel thì block vĩnh viễn. Gán ch = nil trong vòng lặp select là cách chuẩn của Go để tắt một luồng đã kết thúc mà không đốt CPU.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gcnil { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gcnil-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gcnil svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gcnil text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gcnil-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gcnil-card.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gcnil-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gcnil-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gcnil-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gcnil-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gcnil-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gcnil-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gcnil-h-red { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gcnil-h-ok { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gcnil-h-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gcnil-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gcnil-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gcnil-code-red { font-size: 11.2px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gcnil-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  .gcnil-code-ok { font-size: 11.2px; font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gcnil-ok,
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gcnil-code-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gcnil-m { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gcnil-ring-red { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 3 3; opacity: 0.45; }
  .gcnil-pulse-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .gcnil-flow-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gcnil-pulse-ok { fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gcnil-flow-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gcnil-pulse-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gcnil figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
